Differs from the 0.8.7 form: 0.9.0 already moves the first tab of a hanging line to the hang position in line breaking and measurement and skips placeholder tabs; the 0.8.7 stop insertion is not re-applied (it would duplicate this). Not carried: the right/center-tab detectors do not see the automatic left stop.
